==German==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|de|nds|-}} and {{der|de|gml|krabbe}}, probably from the root of {{m|de|krabbeln}}.

Cognate with {{cog|nl|krab}}, {{cog|en|crab}}, {{cog|non|krabbi}}. Further origin unknown; either from a {{der|de|qfa-sub|}} language, or, if inherited, related to {{m|de|kerben}}. Compare {{cog|la|carabus}}.

